Enter:

pscf_rpc -d 3 -e -p param_lram -c command

to apply the COMPRESS command to the fields in in/w.rf with an
LrAmCompressor (script run). The parameter files param_am and param_lr
use an AmCompressor and an LrCompressor instead (scripts run_am and
run_lr). Then enter

python3 Incompress_check.py

to print the sum over all grid points of the deviation of the total
concentration in out/c_rf from 1.
